All,

Orders for 3G 2" PVC Collets should not be filled without confirming that t=
hey are going in 3G 2" fittings.  3G 2" fittings have a part number prefix =
of 75.

If a PVC Collet is required for a 2" 2G fitting they must use the 2G 2" PVC=
 Collet which has a part number prefix of 77.

Please talk to Cindy if you are confused.

J


--_000_4414AEBBCFB2B648B49E5766D309768E980EA0CF82MAIL_
